# TOON KICKERS — 3D CARTOON FOOTBALL GAME

Create a complete, playable browser-based football game called **TOON KICKERS**.

The game features two cartoon football teams competing in exciting matches. Use medium-quality 3D cartoon graphics, smooth character animations, simple controls, intelligent AI opponents, and a beautiful gaming website.

The game must be genuinely playable, not just a static website.

## 1. Game Identity

Name: TOON KICKERS

Tagline: TWO TEAMS. ONE GOAL. TOTAL FOOTBALL FUN.

Color palette:
- Stadium Green: #168447
- Deep Navy: #14213D
- Bright Orange: #FF8C42
- Sky Blue: #55B8E8
- White: #FFFFFF

Use rounded typography, clean layouts, attractive buttons, colorful cartoon characters, and beautiful stadium environments.

## 2. Main Website Homepage

Create a beautiful gaming homepage with:

- Large cartoon football stadium background.
- Two opposing teams facing each other.
- Large heading: LET THE MATCH BEGIN!
- Play Now button.
- Select Team button.
- Game Modes button.
- Leaderboard button.

Add animated footballs, floating stars, subtle motion effects, and a friendly sports atmosphere.

## 3. Two Football Teams

Create two original cartoon teams.

TEAM BLUE — SKY STRIKERS
- Blue jerseys.
- White shorts.
- Blue football socks.
- Energetic and fast players.

TEAM ORANGE — FIRE KICKERS
- Orange jerseys.
- Black shorts.
- Orange socks.
- Strong and competitive players.

Each team should have:
- 1 goalkeeper.
- 4 defenders.
- 3 midfielders.
- 3 attackers.

Create 11 players per team with different faces, hairstyles, body shapes, and player numbers.

Use consistent medium-quality 3D cartoon models. Players should look friendly, expressive, and recognizable.

## 4. Actual Football Gameplay

Create a fully playable football match.

The player controls Team Blue while Team Orange is controlled by AI.

Gameplay features:
- Football passing.
- Shooting.
- Dribbling.
- Tackling.
- Goalkeeper saves.
- Player switching.
- Ball possession.
- Corner kicks.
- Goal kicks.
- Throw-ins.
- Goals and match celebrations.

Make player movement smooth and responsive.

## 5. Controls

Desktop controls:

- W / Up Arrow: Move forward.
- S / Down Arrow: Move backward.
- A / Left Arrow: Move left.
- D / Right Arrow: Move right.
- Space: Shoot.
- J: Pass.
- K: Sprint.
- L: Tackle.
- Tab: Switch player.

Mobile controls:

- Virtual joystick on the left.
- Shoot button.
- Pass button.
- Sprint button.
- Tackle button.
- Switch player button.

Add a short tutorial to teach new players the controls.

## 6. AI Football System

Make the opposing team intelligent.

AI players should:
- Chase the ball.
- Pass to teammates.
- Move into open spaces.
- Defend their goal.
- Attempt shots.
- Tackle the opponent.
- Position themselves strategically.

When the player has the ball, nearby opponents should try to defend and take possession.

## 7. Goalkeeper System

Create an animated goalkeeper for both teams.

Features:
- Jump left and right.
- Catch the ball.
- Block powerful shots.
- Dive towards the ball.
- Kick the ball away.
- Celebrate successful saves.

