## 15. Technical Requirements

- Use HTML, CSS, JavaScript and Three.js.
- Build actual 3D football gameplay.
- Use medium-quality optimized cartoon 3D models.
- Implement ball physics and player movement.
- Implement AI-controlled opponents and teammates.
- Add functional shooting, passing, tackling, and goalkeeping.
- Support desktop and mobile controls.
- Save basic game progress using local storage.
- Ensure smooth performance on normal computers.

Do not create decorative buttons or a nonfunctional game demo.

## FINAL GOAL

Create an enjoyable, medium-complexity 3D cartoon football game where two complete teams play against each other.

The first version must have two teams, 22 players, a playable football pitch, AI opponents, ball movement, shooting, passing, goalkeeping, a scoreboard, and match results.

Prioritize working football gameplay, attractive cartoon characters, and smooth performance over complicated graphics.
